-- title:
--   Generators descend to the quotient
-- statement:
--   Let $G$ be an abelian group. If $a,d,h\in G$ generate $G$, their images satisfy $$\langle\bar a,\bar d\rangle=G/\langle h\rangle.$$
--
--   The subgroup generated by $h$ is the integer-multiple subgroup; no finiteness or torsion assumptions are needed.
